# `data/processed/` — Reusable analysis-ready data

## Authority

See the root [`README.md`](../../README.md) contract and
[`../AGENTS.md`](../AGENTS.md).

Use this directory for pipeline-generated datasets that form a reusable input
to later stages or analyses: normalized tables, feature matrices, or converted
formats with a declared schema. The pipeline owns their bytes.

Payloads are ignored by Git. They are normally regenerated; snapshot a named
dataset with {{ data_versioning }} only when its exact bytes must be shared or
survive cleanup, and commit the pointer rather than the payload. Report-ready
summaries and model outputs that are not reused belong in `results/tables/`.
